<title>USA: Filene's Q4 net, share profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Filene's Q4 net, share profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WELLESLEY, Mass. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>Following results for 13 weeks ended February 1, 1997, as compared to 14-week period in fiscal year 1995:</p>
<p>						     Fiscal quarter ended</p>
<p>							  Feb 1,     Feb 3,</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales					  $153,689   $170,322</p>
<p>Cost of sales, including buying,</p>
<p>  receiving and occupancy costs:	     118,810    149,008</p>
<p>     Gross profit				   34,879     21,314</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative</p>
<p>  expenses					    32,069     39,400</p>
<p>Amortization of intangible assets and</p>
<p>  beneficial operating lease rights		367	  338</p>
<p> Store closing reserve				 ---     11,377</p>
<p>     Operating income (loss)		     2,443   (29,801)</p>
<p> Interest expense, net				 549	1,371</p>
<p> Income (loss) before income taxes	     1,894   (31,172)</p>
<p> Income tax provision (benefit)		    720	 (54)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)				   1,174  ( 31,118)</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per common share	     0.06    ( 1.52)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding	  21,127     20,481</p>
<p>		Fiscal year ended	  February 1,  February 3,</p>
<p>							   1997	 1996</p>
<p>    Net sales				    $545,025   $582,509</p>
<p>Cost of sales, including buying,</p>
<p>     receiving and occupancy costs:	 412,155    464,411</p>
<p>    Gross profit				  132,870    118,098</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative</p>
<p>     expenses				     117,238    132,666</p>
<p>Amortization of intangible assets and</p>
<p>     beneficial operating lease rights	1,467	1,352</p>
<p>    Store closing reserve			   ---     11,377</p>
<p>    Operating income (loss)		    14,165    (27,297)</p>
<p>    Interest expense, net			 3,735	4,927</p>
<p>    Income (loss) before income taxes	10,430    (32,224)</p>
<p>    Income tax provision (benefit)	    3,964	 (433)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss)			    $6,466   ($31,791)</p>
<p>    Net income (loss) per common share	$0.31     ($1.56)</p>
<p>    Weighted average shares outstanding    21,064     20,403</p>
<p>NOTES: Fiscal 1995 operating results include Q4 charges of $30.1 million for strategic repositioning that included planned store closings. Full company name is Filene's Basement Corp.</p>
</text>
